Hi,

I have submitted the mentoring organization application for the Linux 
Foundation for this year's GSoC, and put up the project ideas list for 
OpenPrinting.

Here is the list:

https://wiki.linuxfoundation.org/gsoc/google-summer-code-2019-openprinting-projects

I hope I did not forget any project and also did all project 
descriptions correctly.

Please check whether all is OK with the listed ideas and correct if 
something is wrong.

Please also add any forgotten project ideas and remove projects which 
are already done (I hope I have caught all of these ones).

Also any further project ideas are welcome.

If you are not able to edit the page please tell me your Linux 
Foundation user name (create an account if you do not have one). Or send 
me your desired changes.

    Till
